Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1824
Function: libxml_xmlSetValidErrors
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyValidCtxt_Get(pyobj_ctx) is not checked for NULL before assigning to ctxt->error/ctxt->warning/ctxt->userData, causing a NULL pointer dereference when an invalid validator context is passed from Python.

